            report.put("limitations",List.of("Mar/Apr2021 target holdings finish on June1 before the earliest exposed S&P source calendar June7; unused status requires the separate global source-use audit. Cancelled2022 targets were not executed.","Reconstructed historical data, not a prospective untouched holdout; researcher knowledge cannot be disproved.","Twelve densely spaced training decisions have heavily overlapping20D labels.360rows are not360independent observations and do not replace12independent monthly cohorts.","Missing analyst/news/institution history retains production neutral behavior; no factors or weights are refitted.","Historical share observations may be stale and reconstructed nominal price basis needs separate review, especially provider-rounded spin-off adjustment inversions.","Early OOF periods below production minimum300rows have no predictions; thresholds are unchanged.","Empty macro input retains the production unavailable-macro fallback; no historical current macro is substituted."));
            Files.writeString(out.resolve("result.json"),json.writerWithDefaultPrettyPrinter().writeValueAsString(report),StandardOpenOption.CREATE_NEW);
            System.out.println("STRICT_DOW_2021_DONE training="+training.size()+" predictions="+predictionsAll.size()+" databaseWrites=0");
